  {"date": "2012-06-16", "venue": "Bader Field", "city": "Atlantic City", "state": "NJ", "gap": 2, "set": "2", "times": 2, "jamchart": true, "jam": "A fast break from \"Light\" -> to a quick rendition of \"Manteca.\" Fantastic stuff. Remainder of the jam is Fish-driven and unlike another \"Light\" jam. There is quality \"Type I\" jamming as the band shreds over \"Manteca\" and \"Crosseyed\" teases.", "out": "->", "prev": "Slave to the Traffic Light", "in": ">", "next": "Manteca", "nb": 1},
