  {"date": "2023-07-30", "venue": "Madison Square Garden", "city": "New York", "state": "NY", "gap": 9, "set": "2", "jamchart": true, "jam": "Strange and cool jam. Play quickly, and especially for \"Light,\" becomes muddled and murky. This isn't to suggest the version isn't musical or, in parts, melodic; rather, the first part of the jam possesses many unique qualities. Just for a bit. Pleasant bleakness considerably brightens, and that by way of experimental play is erased by a bright, peak-driven conclusion.", "prev": "Gotta Jibboo", "in": ">", "xnext": "Suzy Greenberg", "nb": 1},
